                                "sense_id": "571e9f16-d436-3973-bfeb-37c4681d7158",
                                "text": "The first laboratory visit involved a familiarisation session, anthropometric measurements, and baseline 1RM testing for isometric and dynamic concentric and eccentric contractions using an electromechanical dynamometer (System 4 Pro, Biodex Medical Systems, New York, USA)."
                            }
